{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10944","headline":"白凫行 · 杜甫","name":"白凫行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见黄鹄高於五尺童，化爲白凫似老翁。\n故畦遗穗已荡尽，天寒岁暮波涛中。\n鳞介腥羶素不食，终日忍饥西复东。\n鲁门鶢鶋亦蹭蹬，闻道如今犹避风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10944.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10944","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}